cuems-common (1.3.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * rtpmidid: gate node startup on controller reachability via the
    cuems-wait-controller ExecStartPre, fixing the cold-boot MTC zombie
    where rtpmidid raced an unconfigured link-local route (control channel
    up, no MTC data). No-op on controllers.
  * videocomposer: wait for Plymouth to release DRM master before start,
    fixing black panels (modeset "Permission denied") after boot.
  * rtpmidid: set explicit port=5004 in the node [connect_to].
  * Ship cuems-power-bridge poweroff sudoers; Shelly power-bridge support.
  * network: persist Wake-on-LAN via post-up ethtool in interfaces.
  * link files: correct 10-wifi0.link Path= to N97 default; document the
    RTL8852BE driver gap on stock bookworm.
  * Incorporate the debian/bookworm packaging line (merge): controller-engine
    LD_LIBRARY_PATH for python_rtmidi's bundled libjack; CPU governor set to
    performance + self-signed SSL cert provisioning in postinst; control
    dependency refresh (add cpufrequtils, avahi-autoipd, libapache2-mod-dnssd,
    ifenslave, net-tools; Conflicts network-manager; ddcutil promoted to
    Depends); xinitrc.cuems conffile override. Built on the
    debian/bookworm-pre_release_1 integration branch.

